[stderr] +Atomically update the JSON and Markdown ledgers with chapter state, allocations,
[stderr] +counters, and the D0003 checkpoint only after validation. Retain reserved IDs on
[stderr] +repair; never renumber, replace, or rewrite an accepted B/R contract.
[stderr] +
