| Chapter ID | Document / owner | Depends on | State |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| SPEC-00 | `00-domain-discovery.md` / product discovery | INITIAL | complete |
| SPEC-01 | `01-product-brief.md` / product | SPEC-00 | complete |
